{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/extras/5501c68ba9464d416b33c18947b71025.avif?t=1761667209\" width=612 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are days when time seems to stand still and work feels tedious. For those days and all the others,\u00a0<strong>My Desktop Friend</strong> offers you a companion that rewards your productivity, doesn\u2019t distract you, and actually helps you with your daily tasks through tools that keep you focused and make sure you don\u2019t forget anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/extras/3b8ab8c261f71492591e1954c1526933.avif?t=1761667209\" width=243 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply using your computer earns you coins that can be spent on gifts for your pet or decorations for your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/extras/5dba0dc3eab9a69b0f922a26dd4850dc.avif?t=1761667209\" width=301 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your desktop cozier and more personalized over time by using the various decoration items you collect along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/extras/44069b4f48250aeec67912643ef176ae.avif?t=1761667209\" width=202 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never forget a task again! With the notes tool, you can ask your pet to remind you of your to-dos at specific dates and times.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/extras/e31ae6d0dac4d6da5112cf57b83d0b12.avif?t=1761667209\" width=279 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having trouble concentrating? Not here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pomodoro tool will help you perfectly balance when it\u2019s time to focus and when it\u2019s time to rest.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705840?t=1761667209","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/c2eb66cad92d86cde434e7a15b77511b8f7a1445/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761667209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/9723bdf0f8417327dfc3869f939ca68b15f92295/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761667209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/9723bdf0f8417327dfc3869f939ca68b15f92295/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761667209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705840/extras/5501c68ba9464d416b33c18947b71025.avif?t=1761667209\" width=612 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are days when time seems to stand still and work feels tedious. For those days and all the others,\u00a0<strong>My Desktop Friend</strong> offers you a companion that rewards your productivity, doesn\u2019t distract you, and actually helps you with your daily tasks through tools that keep you focused and make sure you don\u2019t forget anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 